@startuml
title Sequence - ma hoa tin nhan va kiem tra tep tren Dispatch
actor "Nguoi gui" as A
participant "React A" as RA
participant "Spring Boot" as BE
database "TiDB" as DB
participant "WebSocket" as WS
participant "React B" as RB
collections "Supabase" as SB
== Tin nhan TEXT ==
A -> RA: Nhap TEXT va nhan Gui
RA -> BE: GET /conversations/{id}/aes-key (JWT)
BE -> DB: Lay aes_key / wrapped_aes_key
DB --> BE: Thong tin khoa
note right of BE: Mo khoa ElGamal (neu co wrapped)\nBackend van biet raw AES key
BE --> RA: AES key (neu du quyen)
RA -> RA: Sinh IV; encrypt AES-256-GCM
RA -> BE: POST /chat/messages (ciphertext, iv, version; content=null)
BE -> DB: Luu ban ma
BE -> WS: Publish DTO ban ma
WS --> RB: Message ciphertext/iv
RB -> BE: GET AES key hoi thoai (JWT)
BE --> RB: AES key (neu du quyen)
RB -> RB: Giai ma AES-GCM + verify tag
RB --> A: Tin moi duoc hien thi ben nguoi nhan
== Dinh kem / SHA-256 ==
A -> RA: Chon tep
RA -> RA: SHA-256(bytes)
RA -> BE: POST /media/upload (file, sha256)
BE -> BE: SHA-256(stream) va so sanh
alt Hash dung / du quyen
  BE -> SB: Luu tep
  SB --> BE: OK
  BE --> RA: URL, file size, sha256
  RA -> BE: Gui IMAGE/FILE message
else Hash sai
  BE --> RA: HTTP 400; khong luu
end
@enduml
